        "b": 362.24517822265625
      },
      "markdown": "| Hazard level   | Indication                                                                                                                        |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| DANGER:        | A hazardous situation which, if not avoided, will result in death or serious injury                                               |\n| WARNING:       | A hazardous situation which, if not avoided, could result in death or serious injury                                              |\n| CAUTION:       | A hazardous situation which, if not avoided, could result in minor or moderate injury                                             |\n| NOTICE:        | • A potential situation which, if not avoided, could result in undesirable conditions • A practice not related to personal injury |",
      "rows": 5,
      "cols": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_36",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
